[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=25 format=3]

; PLACEHOLDER project UI Theme. Every UI colour, StyleBox, font size and layout margin lives here.
; Restyle freely in the Godot Theme editor. Type variations (TilaokMenuButton, GhostValid, ...) are used by
; name from the scenes: you may change what they look like, but do not rename them.
; Base types (Button, PanelContainer...) keep engine-default shape so developer fixture HUDs do not shift;
; the screens use the named type variations below. Restyle those.
; Fonts: engine default (no font file shipped). Set a font under Default Font to change all text.

